            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A catheter assembly (10) includes: a hollow catheter (12); a catheter hub (14) adapted to fix and hold the catheter (12); an inner needle (16) having a needlepoint (16a) and detachably inserted into the catheter (12); and a needle hub (18) adapted to fix and hold the inner needle (16). Additionally, the catheter assembly (10) includes a catheter operation member (20) capable of moving the catheter (12) relative to the inner needle (16). The catheter operation member (20) includes a holding portion (58) adapted to directly hold the catheter (12) in a detachable manner.</p>
            </abstract>
